# Per-run JSONs under results/. These were tracked as the experimental record, but at ~450
# runs the per-pair rows are 75 MB and every sweep adds more, which swamps code review.
# Already-tracked files stay tracked: untracking them would delete them from every other
# checkout on the next pull. Aggregated comparisons at results/*.json remain tracked.
